Note (1): With an eccentricity of 0, the time of periastron passage is
 ill-defined. In this case, T_p_ indicates the time of primary transit.
Note (2): f: We fixed the {gamma} of the S+ and S- dataset at a common value.
Note (3): Residual O-C and RV {gamma} of supplementary data from different
  instruments used to calculate these orbits are given in tableb7.dat.
